.TH LAYEREDGIT 1
.SH NAME
layeredgit \- open layeredgit for the current working tree
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B layeredgit
.RI [ BASE ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Add or select the working tree containing the current directory in layeredgit's
repository sidebar, and bring the window to the front. The review shows the
merge base, selected head, and any changes from that head's worktree.
.PP
With
.IR BASE ,
set the saved comparison base for this repository. The default tries
.BR origin/HEAD ,
.BR main ,
then
.BR master .
